------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Method:      netPopupCallbackDestPartWld
--
-- Description: Initialise popup menu for destination part world list
--
-- Method Type: Function/Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
--    1   R      ARRAY       !a[0] is cursor x position
--                           !a[1] is cursor x position
--                           !a[2] is array of selected row tags
